{'symbol': 'CPB', 'date': '2021-12-14 12:50:00', 'title': 'CAMPBELL OUTLINES NEXT PHASE OF STRATEGY TO DRIVE PROFITABLE GROWTH', 'text': "CAMDEN, N.J.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--CAMPBELL SOUP COMPANY (NYSE:CPB) TODAY HELD AN INVESTOR DAY WHERE MEMBERS OF THE CAMPBELL MANAGEMENT TEAM REVIEWED THE COMPANY'S ADVANTAGED POSITION IN LARGE AND GROWING CONSUMER CATEGORIES AND PRESENTED THE NEXT PHASE OF ITS STRATEGY TO UNLOCK ITS FULL GROWTH POTENTIAL. “CAMPBELL IS CLEARLY A STRONGER COMPANY TODAY THAN WE WERE THREE YEARS AGO,” SAID MARK CLOUSE, CAMPBELL'S PRESIDENT AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER. “WE HAVE A COMPELLING AND CREDIBLE PLAN TO CONTINUE"}